WEBVTT

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.340
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.460
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.670
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:13.840
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.010
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.270
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.490
<b>Restoration Plan No. 15

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.770
<i>I've collected a ton of mana crystals.</i>

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:41.620
<i>I've made my former nemesis, 
the magical girl, my pawn.</i>

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.580
<i>And I've even seen the the Dark Lord revived!</i>

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:48.740
<i>She's still at </i>her<i> place, 
but at least she's back!</i>

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.680
<i>Either way, I'm so close to 
restoring the Dark Realm!</i>

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.420
<i>When I tell Kokoro,</i>

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.310
<i>I'm sure she'll commend
 and encourage me more than ever.</i>

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.260
Amazing!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:01.300
<i>In fact...</i>

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.960
<i>I </i>should<i> be praised and commended way more!</i>

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:08.060
Sorry to keep you waiting, Great Jahy!

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:08.780
<i>There she is!</i>

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.770
You're sliding today, huh?

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:19.000
Say, Kokoro, notice anything 
different about me?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.280
Different?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.990
<i>Go ahead! Worship me!</i>

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.940
Um...

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.870
<i>Come on! Lay on the praise!</i>

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.710
Do you mean the new girl behind you?

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:31.940
Huh?

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.940
Can I play with you guys, too?!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.160
Who are you?

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.170
Oh, I'm...

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.860
Stay the hell away from Kokoro!

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.800
Is she your friend, Great Jahy?

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.850
No! She's...

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.020
Yeah, she's my friend! She's a friend.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.960
We need to split, Kokoro.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:57.690
What?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.690
She's real bad news.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.500
Better not let her get near you.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.910
Really?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:09.120
She can take a washing machine, a truck, 
or a lightning bolt and shrug it off!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.550
That's incredible!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.830
It's not incredible. It's freaky.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.710
All right, let's go!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.010
I get it.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.630
We're playing tag!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.300
Leap!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.640
You're it now, Jahy-kun.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.030
Come, let us flee!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:31.800
Sure!

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.430
How dare she?!

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.570
Kokoro is <i>my</i> underling!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.790
Great Jahy!

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.400
Come and get us!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.030
Oh, look at those kids.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.830
A high schooler playing
with such a young girl?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.500
That's so...

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.290
<i>Good. Be suspicious.</i>

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:58.500
<i>Call the police and tell them a weirdo
 is trying something with children!</i>

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.900
That's so nice of her!

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.510
Look at her, playing with that little girl.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.470
What a nice kid.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:06.610
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>What the hell?!</i>

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.990
Miss!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.270
Are you okay?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.270
Ow...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.600
What is this hole doing here?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.420
Here!

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.940
It's hard to get up by yourself.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.030
Thank you.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.520
Come help, Great Jahy!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.000
Why should I?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.320
She can get up by herself, anyway.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.760
But it's faster if we both pull.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.090
Fine...

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.480
Ready, and...

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.620
Heave-ho!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:01.680
I'm sorry!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.820
Now you're both dirty, too.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.680
What's so funny?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:14.000
It's just... now we're
all covered in dirt! See?

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:17.960
That was fun!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.590
Jeez.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.150
Yeah!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:35.950
I'm glad I followed Jahy-kun and 
mustered the courage to talk to you!

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.480
Don't follow me.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:43.360
Your friend is wonderful, Great Jahy.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.150
Huh? Wonderful?

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:51.860
This is the <i>JABLEEP</i> who destroyed the 
Dark Realm and stole my mana crystals.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.600
But now you're friends, right?

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.370
I suppose.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:06:01.130
My mother told me that being able 
to make up is a wonderful thing.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:05.600
It's so amazing that people can become 
friends even if things used to be bad!

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.240
Why are you blushing?!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.640
Sheesh.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.680
<i>In spite of herself,
 the Great Jahy didn't hate this.</i>

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.790
So, what are we going to play next?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.880
Kokoro is <i>my</i> playmate.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.850
Shoo, shoo.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.760
But... we're friends.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.590
Don't act like you're friends with her, too.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.650
She <i>is</i> my friend.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.430
We're friends, right?

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:33.240
Kokoro!

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.420
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.720
<i>The Dark Lord was house-sitting 
for the magical girl.</i>

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.230
<i>Damn that magical girl...</i>

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.220
<i>Jahy-kun!</i>

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.430
<i>Jahy-kun!</i>

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.890
<i>Ah, Jahy-kun!</i>

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:04.360
<i>The only time I'm free of her is at work.</i>

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:08.070
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:08.070
<i>Never thought I'd look forward 
to clocking in this much.</i>

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.150
Welcome!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.110
Hey!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.450
Wh-What the hell are you doing here?!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.930
Oh, Hy-chan, you know her?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.160
If so, that'll make this easier.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:23.830
Jingu Kyouko-chan will be 
working for us starting today.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:24.820
Isn't that right?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.030
So that's your name...

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:31.610
You're her senior coworker here, 
so please show Kyouko-chan the ropes.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.970
What?!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.290
She destroyed my Dark Realm
 and now I have to—

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.100
Just one moment.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.830
Boss!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:46.220
What's the big idea, following my every step?!

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.360
You're so close!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.060
I am not!

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:53.070
<i>You're</i> the stalker who 
followed me even to work!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.180
Me, a stalker?! P-Please, hold on a moment!

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:59.600
I know I've been following you around, 
but this was pure coincidence!

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:00.980
Like I'd buy that!

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.080
Please believe me!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.790
<b>Part-time Work
Hiring Now!
 Wait & Kitchen Staff

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:05.790
I found this flyer for part-time employees.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:08.350
And I was hired just now.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.480
I've been so lucky lately!

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:15.800
To think this random job I found
happened to be where you work...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:19.140
Hmph. Why are you suddenly 
getting a job anyway?

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:26.980
Until now, I found meaning in 
shouldering the misfortunes of others.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.850
But ever since you saved me,

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:34.980
I've decided to stop that. 
I'm going to try to learn new things.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:40.040
To make you and others happy myself.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:47.690
However, I've realized that in order
to make people happy, you need money.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.130
<i>The bitter truth!</i>

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:53.090
Is this because the Dark Lord
is eating you out of house and home?

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.300
Knew it...

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.550
<i>Your Lordship...</i>

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.800
<i>You are truly terrifying.</i>

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.210
Come with me.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.190
How to prepare warm hand towels.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.640
How to take orders.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.130
How to carry out the dishes.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.720
How to wash the plates.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:17.780
I'll teach you everything.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:25.950
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.010
I'm looking forward to it!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.970
Here you go!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:29.410
Thank you.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.970
Please enjoy!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.220
<i>Having extra help will make things easier.</i>

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:40.190
<i>I'll have her doing my bidding... </i>Geh!<i></i>

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.140
Huh?

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:43.970
Huh?!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.430
What's going on?

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.980
How does that even happen?!

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.360
H-H-H-Here's your o-order.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.820
Huh? We didn't order all this.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.140
<i>How'd she manage that?!</i>

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.300
I'm sorry!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.300
This is actually for the table over there.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.330
I need the drinks for table three!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.870
O-On it!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.160
<i>This isn't right.</i>

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:47.390
<i>Having extra help was supposed 
to make things easier.</i>

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.260
Where's my order?

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.420
I'd like to place an order!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.840
Where's my draft beer?

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:54.540
<i>Why is there </i>more<i> work for me?!</i>

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:57.510
Is there anything I can do, Jahy-kun?

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.450
You can stand there and watch!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.430
Don't move!

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.310
Don't worry, Kyouko-chan.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.820
It's hard for everyone at first.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.460
Hy-chan was horrible, too, when she started.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.030
She was?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:21.110
Jahy-chan? Can you take this 
out to table seven, please?

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:24.570
Moron. Like I'd do 
what some human tells me to.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.040
But Hy-chan does her best.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.360
No matter what it is, she gives it her all.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:38.920
You remind me of her in some ways, 
so I'm sure you'll get the hang of things soon.

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:41.980
Boss...

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:45.600
Hey, were you watching?

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:49.430
If you want to be of any use,
 you'd better keep a good eye on me.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.430
Right!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.060
Here's how you pour the beer! Got it?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:54.980
I see.

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.560
It's not just about brute strength!

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.440
Brute strength is no good...

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.250
You have to be more careful!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.900
Be more careful...

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.060
Can we place an order?

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:06.370
Coming!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:06.370
Be right with you!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.280
I did it!

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:21.740
Thanks, new girl.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.880
O-Oh, of course.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.800
Hey, there's something in your hair.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.840
A mana crystal?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.190
Here you go!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.700
I'd like to order, please!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:36.940
Go right ahead!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:44.750
<i>I was pretty worried at first, but I guess
it was just the mana crystal's meddling.</i>

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.620
Kyouko-chan is doing great.

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:51.080
You must be a good mentor.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.750
I <i>am</i> the second-in-command of the Dark Realm.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:59.590
I've left everything up to you so far,

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:00.710
but from now on...

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.800
From now on...

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.470
From now on, we'll see 
each other every day, Jahy-kun!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.470
During the day!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:12.970
And in the evenings!

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:16.650
From now on, we'll always be together!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.380
No!

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:25.830
<i>The Great Jahy couldn't escape
 the magical girl's shackles.</i>

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.370
<b>Closed</b>

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.620
Hy-chan, I have a favor to ask you.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:34.790
Nope.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:37.980
How can you say no when you 
don't even know what it is?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:42.030
Because you're probably just going to say
 "let's go on a diet together" or something.

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.480
Go ask someone else.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.800
Someone else...

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.290
Kyouko-chan!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.510
Yes?

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:51.720
I've wiped down all the tables!

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.500
Thank you.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.440
Say, I've been trying to think 
of some new menu items.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.600
I was wondering if you'd do a taste test.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.690
<i>Did she say a taste test?</i>

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:05.670
I've had so many ideas
 that I'm just not sure anymore.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.340
And Hy-chan seems to be busy. 
Can I count on you instead?

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:12.110
Pleased to be of service, Boss!

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:14.290
Then please wait for me at that table.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:22.590
If you want me to eat that bad,
 then fine, I'll eat.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:27.050
Oh, wow! Getting both of your 
opinions will be so helpful.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.570
Sure. Bring it on out, then.

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.180
Just a moment.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.220
All right. Here you go.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.370
Stewed flounder?

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:42.360
I've made the flavors a bit stronger.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.650
Thank you for the food.

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:50.490
It's delicious!

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:54.840
Yes, the flavor is strong, 
but it's not overpowering.

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.900
The more I chew, the more I can taste
how the umami of the fish

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.500
and the broth harmonize with each other.

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:04.000
It's what French cuisine 
calls a marriage of flavors!

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.740
Boss, this stewed flounder is amazing!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.620
Thank you, Kyouko-chan.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.800
And what do you think, Hy-chan?

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.260
It's not bad.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.220
It's not bad, but...

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:21.210
It's not bad, but...?

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:25.940
What if you replaced the fish with meat?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:33.400
<i>I get to eat for free here, so I'm going 
to suggest everything I normally can't afford.</i>

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.510
I see!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:41.500
<i>Overthinking clouded the boss's judgment!</i>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.050
Rather than the seasonings,

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.170
she's suggested modifying the main ingredient!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.590
Amazing, Jahy-kun!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:51.380
<i>Her adoration for the Great Jahy
clouded Kyouko's judgment!</i>

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:54.060
Next, I have some ginger pork.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:57.350
<i>All right! Meat!</i>

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:01.310
The idea behind this dish is 
to encourage more drinking.

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:05.440
It's delicious!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:12.170
Unlike the flounder earlier, the seasoning 
on this is reserved for the dish.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:15.450
But when you consider that, 
rather than rice,

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:19.210
it'll be served as an accompaniment
to booze, it works perfectly!

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:22.040
Not that I had any sake, of course...

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:25.250
You're like a gourmet critic, Kyouko-chan!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.750
It's good to have you here.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:33.230
<i>I haven't had meat in so long!</i>

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.570
<i>It's revitalizing me!</i>

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:39.800
Well?

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:42.980
Yeah, it's not bad.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.900
It's not bad, but...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.970
It's not bad, but...?

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:53.490
It's not bad, but if you really want
 a hit dish, why don't you try beef?

00:16:55.260 --> 00:17:00.600
And the good kind! Luxurious steak.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.620
I see!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.580
<i>The boss wasn't thinking anymore!</i>

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.050
Steak instead of ginger pork?

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.540
This is...

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.670
Even though it's a pub...

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:14.650
No, this might be the way to create a new 
dish that can only be enjoyed in a pub!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:18.050
Something unpretentious yet luxurious!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.150
You're amazing, Jahy-kun!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:25.520
<i>Kyouko's adoration for the Great Jahy 
 was </i>really<i> clouding her judgment!</i>

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:31.730
<i>I've been cooking for myself ever 
since I came to the human world.</i>

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:35.010
<i>We don't always get 
staff meals here at the pub,</i>

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.230
<i>but when we do, they're never beef.</i>

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:42.780
<i>And what they sell at the supermarkets is 
so expensive, I can never afford it.</i>

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:48.080
<b>Black Wagyu</b>

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:48.080
<b>Domestic Black Beef Wagyu Steak</b>

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.700
<i>Yet among them, the steak is
 the biggest and the thickest.</i>

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:53.390
<i>Every time I see it, I can't help
 wondering what it tastes like.</i>

00:17:54.420 --> 00:18:01.390
<i>Something that pricey... must be delicious!</i>

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.040
Presenting diced steak!

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:11.560
<i>Is this it? Steak?!</i>

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.320
It smells great.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.120
I improvised the sauce.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.280
Well, please give it a try!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.010
Delicious!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:29.680
The steak's juices are delicately 
 combining with the sauce!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:35.010
And the cubes of steak give it 
a firm and irresistible texture!

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:37.260
Not to mention, it's so easy to eat!

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.510
<i>It's juicy enough to wet my entire mouth!</i>

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:47.200
<i>And the meat's so thick,
it's got a great texture!</i>

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:52.480
<i>Then there's the boss's wonderful
original sweet-and-spicy sauce!</i>

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.140
<i>So good!</i>

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.900
<i>My mouth is overflowing with happiness!</i>

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:02.300
<i>All those times when I was hungry...</i>

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.010
<i>All those bland meals...</i>

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:10.870
<i>Maybe it was all so I could 
be united with this steak platter!</i>

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.210
It's good!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.840
It's too good!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.760
Not even the Dark Realm had meat this good.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.330
Jahy-kun is impressed?

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.620
It's that good?

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.920
I'm so happy!

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:29.770
Then this diced beef steak 
will be our new menu item.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.860
I'm glad you could settle on something, Boss.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:33.700
Me, too!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:37.440
<i>If this makes it on the menu, we might even 
get is as our take-home meal sometimes.</i>

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.520
Thank you so much, Hy-chan, Kyouko-chan.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.910
Hold it!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:43.910
Ryou-chan?

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.370
Sheesh.

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:51.400
What are you going to sell this for?

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.080
You gonna make any profit?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.900
Profit?

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.570
There's no way...

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:59.050
Tch. You had to open your fat mouth.

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:04.030
Oh, no! I thought I'd finally 
found our new menu item!

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.890
White rice, please!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:09.060
Looks like Ja-ko was just making 
you cook stuff she wanted to eat.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.420
Is that true, Jahy-kun?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.770
Stop laughing! You should be ashamed!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.360
Bite me.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.020
Why, you...

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:16.980
Bite me.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:17.730
Pay your rent!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.360
Bite me!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:19.020
Where's my rice?

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:19.690
Are you serious?!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.550
White rice!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.440
Your Lordship?!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.830
When did she get in here?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.690
Oh, how cute!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:35.660
Is she your friend, Hy-chan?

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.060
Where is she from, anyway?

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:39.040
Her clothes are pretty odd.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.850
She lives with me.

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:41.800
You want seconds?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:42.760
Coming right up!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.760
Don't. She'll never stop.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.620
Come on. Let's go home.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.790
Fine, then let's do this.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.790
On the way, you can buy whatever 
snack you want at the convenience store.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.310
Well then, we'll be off now.

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:09.120
See you again tomorrow, Kyouko-chan.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.100
Yes!

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:15.280
Those two look like such close sisters.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.960
So, what's your connection to the little runt?

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.340
That's the Dark Lord!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.920
How insolent of you to call her a runt!

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:28.010
Then why's she with 
that other girl and not you?

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.360
Shut your mouth!

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:32.480
The Dark Lord has her reasons!

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:35.110
You know absolutely nothing about her!

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.960
Stop it, Ja-ko! Stop it!

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:43.030
<i>The diced steak was delicious,</i>

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.480
<i>but because the Great Jahy felt like she'd been</i>

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.950
<i>bested by the magical girl,
she took it out on the landlord.</i>

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>The Dark Lord Doesn't Hold Back!</b>
